{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"flint_scatter","model_identifier":"flint_scatter","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# flint_scatter\n\nChalky white lumps with dark flint showing, scattered in grass, about 1.5 m across.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -29..28, y 0..6, z -20..23 units (1.60 x 0.17 x 1.20 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 27.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 57 x 6 x 42 (w x h x d), centred at x -0, z 2\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): flint to gather\n- `depleted`: a few chalk lumps left\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck |\n"},"resolution":{"width":32,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"lump0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-22.5,0.0,-12.0],"to":[-13.5,5.0,-4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.5,30.0,9.5,35.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[10.0,30.0,18.0,35.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.5,30.0,9.5,35.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[10.0,30.0,18.0,35.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12.5,0.0,21.5,8.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[12.5,0.0,21.5,8.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"6abf8fb3-ca7c-5149-a051-fbb3b006eff9"},{"name":"flint0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-20.25,1.5,-12.5],"to":[-16.2,4.0,-11.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.75,46.0,4.8,