ne). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 27.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 57 x 6 x 42 (w x h x d), centred at x -0, z 2\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): flint to gather\n- `depleted`: a few chalk lumps left\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck |\n"}